# gpu_model route, Jak 1: Sandover hut, beach, jungle at noon; at each checkpoint
# a hold, then four camera turns with a hold after each (docs/3ds-port/gpu_model.md); first
# 20 s of the title flyover over Sandover.
0 log gpumodel view title load
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
1 log gpumodel view title flyover
600 continue village1-hut
601 wait *target* target-continue
602 wait *target* target-stance
603 tod 12
604 log gpumodel view village1-hut d0
754 rx=40
799 -
800 log gpumodel view village1-hut d1
919 rx=40
964 -
965 log gpumodel view village1-hut d2
1084 rx=40
1129 -
1130 log gpumodel view village1-hut d3
1249 rx=40
1294 -
1295 log gpumodel view village1-hut d4
1444 continue beach-start
1445 wait *target* target-continue
1446 wait *target* target-stance
1447 tod 12
1448 log gpumodel view beach-start d0
1598 rx=40
1643 -
1644 log gpumodel view beach-start d1
1763 rx=40
1808 -
1809 log gpumodel view beach-start d2
1928 rx=40
1973 -
1974 log gpumodel view beach-start d3
2093 rx=40
2138 -
2139 log gpumodel view beach-start d4
2288 continue jungle-start
2289 wait *target* target-continue
2290 wait *target* target-stance
2291 tod 12
2292 log gpumodel view jungle-start d0
2442 rx=40
2487 -
2488 log gpumodel view jungle-start d1
2607 rx=40
2652 -
2653 log gpumodel view jungle-start d2
2772 rx=40
2817 -
2818 log gpumodel view jungle-start d3
2937 rx=40
2982 -
2983 log gpumodel view jungle-start d4
3132 log gpumodel route end
